BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 532 Td (Our goal is to explore one focused accessibility challenge: whether a camera and a trained model) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 520 Td (can recognise a limited set of hand signs and present the predicted label in a usable interface. I) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 508 Td (will explain how the user's hand becomes numerical features, how the model predicts, how the) Tj ET
