BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 432 Td (People who use sign language may face communication barriers when others do not understand their) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 420 Td (language. Sign languages are full languages with their own grammar and variation. Recognising a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 408 Td (few isolated hand signs is not the same as understanding a full signed conversation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 396 Td (SAHAYAK is a prototype for a limited set of trained labels. It is not a universal translator and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 384 Td (should not be described as understanding all ISL sentences, facial grammar, regional variation, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 372 Td (every two-handed movement. It is not a replacement for interpreters or a guaranteed communication) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 360 Td (service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 348 Td (Optional context: The 2011 Census of India recorded 5,071,007 people in its "disability in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 336 Td (hearing" category. This is a historical census category, not the number of ISL users and not a) Tj ET
