BT /F2 10 Tf 0.04 0.29 0.56 rg 49 270 Td (4. STARTING FROM ZERO - KEY TERMS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 248 Td (Computer vision means using computers to interpret images or video. In this project, the camera) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 236 Td (provides video frames and a hand-landmark detector estimates key points on visible hands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 224 Td (A landmark is a reference point, such as a fingertip or joint. MediaPipe Hands detects up to 21) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 212 Td (landmarks for each hand. A feature is a measurable value that a model processes; x, y, and z) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 200 Td (landmark coordinates are features in this pipeline.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 188 Td (Machine learning means fitting a model to examples so it can learn statistical patterns and make) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 176 Td (predictions on new inputs. Training fits the model using examples. Inference means using the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 164 Td (trained model to make a prediction for an input it has not necessarily seen before.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 152 Td (A dataset is a collection of labelled examples. A model artifact stores a trained model and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 140 Td (related parameters. A label list names possible classes, but editing a label list does not teach) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 128 Td (the model a new sign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 116 Td (The frontend is what the user sees in the browser. The backend is the server-side application. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 104 Td (API route is a defined address through which the frontend and backend exchange data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 92 Td (A confidence score is model-specific and is not a guarantee of correctness. A threshold may reject) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 80 Td (weak predictions, but it does not remove errors or replace formal evaluation.) Tj ET
