BT /F2 10 Tf 0.04 0.29 0.56 rg 49 790 Td (5. COMPLETE ARCHITECTURE - FOLLOW ONE PREDICTION) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 768 Td (Step 1 - Camera: the browser asks for camera permission and receives a video stream. Frame quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 756 Td (depends on lighting, distance, camera angle, and whether the hands are visible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 744 Td (Step 2 - Landmark detection: MediaPipe Hands runs in the browser and estimates hand key points.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 732 Td (The website draws the landmark overlay locally; the overlay is not the classification result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 720 Td (Step 3 - Feature preparation: JavaScript and backend utilities must agree on the number, order,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 708 Td (normalisation, and meaning of feature values. If formats differ, a model may receive incorrect) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 696 Td (inputs even when the overlay looks correct.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 684 Td (Step 4 - Request: the browser sends a feature vector to a backend API route. The deployed backend) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 672 Td (uses Python and Flask. It loads a trained model artifact and runs inference.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 660 Td (Step 5 - Prediction: the model returns a predicted label and any available confidence information.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 648 Td (Application logic may apply a threshold or reject an uncertain result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 636 Td (Step 6 - Display: the frontend receives the response and updates the result shown to the user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 624 Td (Supporting speech or translation functions may also be available, depending on the feature and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 612 Td (network access.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 600 Td (Memorise the flow: CAMERA -> MEDIAPIPE LANDMARKS -> NUMERIC FEATURES -> BACKEND API -> TRAINED) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 588 Td (MODEL -> PREDICTED LABEL -> WEBSITE DISPLAY.) Tj ET
