BT /F2 10 Tf 0.04 0.29 0.56 rg 49 286 Td (8. TECHNOLOGY STACK - WHAT EACH PIECE DOES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 264 Td (Frontend: HTML defines page structure, CSS handles layout and visual styling, and JavaScript) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 252 Td (handles interactions, camera workflow, landmark drawing, feature preparation, and API requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 240 Td (The frontend is hosted on Vercel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 228 Td (Hand detector: MediaPipe Hands estimates landmarks in the browser. Detection and drawing are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 216 Td (separate from backend classification.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 204 Td (Backend: Python and Flask provide API routes, validate or prepare inputs, load models, run) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 192 Td (predictions, and support other functions. The backend is hosted on Render.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 180 Td (Model artifacts: the project contains backend/model/sahayak_twohand.joblib and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 168 Td (backend/model/sahayak_sequence.joblib. The current artifacts use scikit-learn/joblib. Do not call) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 156 Td (the system TensorFlow-based or a CNN unless the implementation is changed and verified.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 144 Td (Storage: SQLite is used for continuous gesture samples. Database rows and model training data are) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 132 Td (not necessarily the same thing; verify how a model was trained before making a dataset claim.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 120 Td (Configuration: frontend/config.js points the browser at the backend API URL. Render configuration) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 108 Td (and requirements control backend deployment. A service worker may cache static page assets, but) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.21 rg 50 96 Td (caching the page does not make remote inference work offline.) Tj ET
